sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant L as Loader
    participant K as Kernel API
    participant G as Module Graph

    C->>L: ldr_load_exe/dll/driver(req)
    L->>K: vfs_open + vfs_size + vfs_read_at
    K-->>L: full image bytes

    L->>L: ldr_parse_image
    Note right of L: Validate magic/version and parse\nsections/imports/exports/relocs

    L->>K: vm_reserve(preferred,size,flags)
    K-->>L: base
    L->>K: vm_commit(base,size,RW)
    L->>L: ldr_sections_load
    Note right of L: Copy section bytes, zero BSS,\nset vm_protect by section flags

    L->>L: ldr_imports_bind
    Note right of L: Find dependency module by name,\nresolve export by symbol, write IAT slot

    L->>L: ldr_reloc_apply
    Note right of L: ABS64 patch: *(base+rva)=base+addend

    L->>G: ldr_module_register
    L->>L: ldr_call_init(base)

    alt EXE
        L->>K: proc_add_module + proc_set_entry
    else SYS
        L->>L: ldr_driver_finalize_load
    else DLL
        Note right of L: No process bootstrap step
    end

    L-->>C: module handle

    C->>L: ldr_unload_module(module)
    L->>L: ldr_call_deinit(base)
    L->>G: ldr_module_unregister
    L->>K: vm_release(base,size)
    L-->>C: unload complete
